# LA Charge Install — Cursor Rules
# Based on Master Operating System v1.0

## Project Identity
- **Business:** LA Charge Install — EV charger & electrical panel lead-gen site for the San Fernando Valley
- **Model:** Referral/lead-gen only. We are NOT a contractor. We capture demand, qualify leads, and dispatch to a vetted C-10 contractor network.
- **Domain:** lachargeinstall.com
- **Tagline:** "Installed Right. In the Valley."

---

## Tech Stack (Non-Negotiable)
- **Framework:** Next.js 15 with App Router — use Static Site Generation (SSG) for all 30 pages
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS v4 — utility-first only, no custom CSS files unless absolutely necessary
- **Hosting:** Vercel — edge CDN, automatic HTTPS
- **CMS:** Sanity.io (headless) — city pages and service content must be editable via Sanity
- **Forms:** Custom Next.js API route (serverless) or Tally.so — no full-page reloads
- **Analytics:** Vercel Analytics + Plausible — NO Google Analytics (CCPA compliance)
- **Schema:** JSON-LD injected via Next.js `<Script>` component, never inline in HTML
- **Images:** Always use `next/image` with explicit `width` and `height`. Format: WebP/AVIF. Hero image must have `fetchpriority="high"`.
- **Fonts:** `next/font` (local) only — DM Sans (headings) + Inter (body). Zero FOUT.

---

## Performance Budget (Mobile — Must Maintain 100/100 PageSpeed)
- FCP < 1.2s | LCP < 1.8s | TBT < 50ms | CLS < 0.05 | Speed Index < 2.0s
- NO third-party scripts in `<head>` (no GTM, no chat widgets above the fold)
- Tailwind CSS must be purged at build time — target < 8kb CSS bundle
- Google Maps iframes must use `loading="lazy"`
- Fonts must be preloaded with `rel="preload" as="font"`

---

